      "completion": "CSC scoring is first calculated at the factor level, across six operational factors, each representing a distinct and essential governance domain: • 6.1 Industry 4.0 & Security • 6.2 Security & New Best Practice • 6.3 Best Practice & Compliance • 6.4 Compliance & Human-Centric Path • 6.5 Human-Centric & Trust-Transparency • 6.6 Trust-Transparency & Industry / Sector Alignment Each factor shall be scored independently on a normalized 0-100 scale, based only on telemetry metrics relevant to that factor. This structure ensures that: • governance weaknesses cannot be hidden by high aggregate scores, and • CSC ratings reflect balanced, evidence-based governance performance across all critical domains.",
